package Box

// A package function whose flattened name is `Box.Area` — the same key a
// method named `Area` on a TYPE named `Box` would mint. fnIdx is one flat
// namespace, so this file exists to prove that a trait DEFAULT inherited by
// such a type cannot quietly take this function's slot: adding the trait in
// main.voi must not change what `Box.Area()` calls.
func Area() int { return 42 }
